    <string name="guide_apply_body">In the wallpaper studio, tap Apply wallpaper and confirm in the system screen that opens. Your countdowns then tick live on your home screen, and changes you make later update the wallpaper automatically.</string>
    <string name="guide_apply_title">Apply the wallpaper</string>
    <string name="guide_celebrations_body">When a countdown reaches zero, the app celebrates with confetti (once per occurrence for repeating countdowns) and helps you start your next countdown.</string>
    <string name="guide_celebrations_title">Celebrations</string>
    <string name="guide_create_body">Tap the + button on the home screen. Start from a template (birthday, exam, wedding, vacation and more) or from scratch, then set the title, emoji, date, time and accent colour, and tap Save.</string>
    <string name="guide_create_title">Create a countdown</string>
    <string name="guide_delete_body">Swipe a card to the left to delete it. Changed your mind? Tap Undo in the message that appears at the bottom of the screen.</string>
    <string name="guide_delete_title">Delete and undo</string>
    <string name="guide_edit_body">Swipe a countdown card to the right to open it in the editor. Change anything you like and tap Save.</string>
    <string name="guide_edit_title">Edit a countdown</string>
    <string name="guide_order_body">Tap the sort button on the home screen and choose Custom. Then long-press a card and drag it to arrange your list exactly how you like.</string>
    <string name="guide_order_title">Custom order</string>
    <string name="guide_reminders_body">Get notified 7 days before, 1 day before and when a countdown completes; switch each one on or off in the editor. Turn on Daily motivation to get a gentle nudge every day at the time you choose. Allow notifications when Android asks so reminders can reach you.</string>
    <string name="guide_reminders_title">Reminders and daily motivation</string>
    <string name="guide_repeat_body">In the editor, choose how often a countdown repeats: Once, Daily, Weekly, Monthly or Yearly. When a repeating countdown finishes, it automatically rolls over to its next occurrence.</string>
    <string name="guide_repeat_title">Repeating countdowns</string>
    <string name="guide_share_body">Use Share on a countdown to turn it into a beautiful image card and send it to friends or post it on social media.</string>
    <string name="guide_share_title">Share a countdown</string>
    <string name="guide_state_collapsed">Collapsed</string>
    <string name="guide_state_expanded">Expanded</string>
    <string name="guide_still_stuck">Still stuck?</string>
    <string name="guide_still_stuck_body">"Tell us what happened and we'll help you out."</string>
    <string name="guide_studio_body">"Open the wallpaper studio to design your wallpaper with a live preview:
• Styles: Classic, Minimal, Ring or Card
• Fonts, colours and sizes for numbers and titles
• Drag a countdown on the preview to position it
• Backgrounds: solid colour, gradient, a photo from your gallery or from Unsplash
• Blur the background to keep text easy to read"</string>
    <string name="guide_studio_title">Wallpaper studio</string>
    <string name="guide_title">User guide</string>
    <string name="guide_visibility_body">Tap the eye icon on a card to show that countdown on your live wallpaper. Up to %1$d countdowns can be shown at once; hide one to make room for another.</string>
    <string name="guide_visibility_title">Show on wallpaper</string>
    <string name="guide_widget_body">Long-press an empty spot on your home screen, tap Widgets, find Countdown Wallpaper and drag the widget onto your home screen. It shows your next countdown at a glance.</string>
    <string name="guide_widget_title">Home-screen widget</string>
